<InfoLayout title="Privacy Policy" description="Read the CalcFino Tools privacy policy, including calculator data, analytics, cookies and third-party services.">
  <p>This policy explains what information CalcFino Tools processes when you use this website.</p>
  <h2>Calculator data</h2><p>Values entered into our calculators are processed locally by JavaScript in your browser. CalcFino does not send or save those values on a server.</p>
  <h2>Server and technical logs</h2><p>Our hosting provider, Cloudflare, may process standard request information such as IP address, browser type, requested URL, timestamp and security signals to deliver and protect the site. Its handling of that data is governed by Cloudflare's privacy policies.</p>
  <h2>Analytics and cookies</h2><p>The current build does not enable analytics unless a site owner supplies a Google Analytics measurement ID. If analytics is enabled, Google may process usage events and set identifiers according to its policies. The color-theme preference is stored locally in your browser and is not transmitted to CalcFino.</p>
  <h2>Advertising</h2><p>This site uses Google AdSense, a service for including advertisements from Google Inc. ("Google"). Google AdSense uses "cookies", which are text files placed on your computer, to help the site analyze how users use the site. Google AdSense also uses so-called "Web Beacons" (invisible graphics). Through the use of these Web Beacons, information such as visitor traffic on these pages can be evaluated.</p><p>The information generated by cookies and Web Beacons about the use of this site (including your IP address) and delivery of advertising formats is transmitted to and stored by Google on servers in the United States. Google may pass this information on to third parties where required by law, or where such third parties process the information on Google's behalf.</p><p>Google will not associate your IP address with any other data held by Google. You may opt out of the use of cookies by selecting the appropriate settings on your browser. Please note that in this case you may not be able to use all functions of this site to their full extent.</p><p>By using this site, you consent to the processing of data about you by Google in the manner and for the purposes set out above.</p>
  <h2>Third-party services</h2><p>Third-party advertisers may use cookies or web beacons to collect information about your visits to this and other websites in order to provide advertisements about goods and services likely to be of interest to you. If you would like more information about this practice and to know your choices about not having this information used by these companies, visit <a href="http://www.networkadvertising.org/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">http://www.networkadvertising.org/</a>.</p>
  <h2>External links and changes</h2><p>External services have their own privacy practices. We may update this policy when the site's data practices change. The revision date at the top identifies the latest version.</p>
  <h2>Your choices</h2><p>You can clear locally stored theme data through your browser settings, block optional cookies and use browser privacy controls. See the Contact page for privacy questions.</p>
</InfoLayout>
